{"seq":2,"slug":"holiday-calendar-fulfill-cutoff","title":"跨境节日日历与履约截单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-order-payforward-delivery/gift-fulfillment-customs/holiday-calendar-fulfill-cutoff","wordCount":2250,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨境节日日历与履约截单\">跨境节日日历与履约截单</h1><p>礼物销售有一个极为集中的形态：一整年的大部分需求挤在少数几个日期附近。情人节、母亲节、感恩节、圣诞节、农历新年，以及各国本地化的节日——每一个都对应一个<strong>不可延后的到达时刻</strong>。晚了三天，礼物的价值可能从&quot;惊喜&quot;跌到&quot;敷衍&quot;。这让履约系统必须处理一种普通品类不太遇到的问题：<strong>需求在时间轴上是脉冲式的，而产能是平的</strong>。</p>\n<p>本文讲节日履约的三件事：<strong>节日日历如何建模、截单时间如何随节日偏移、以及峰值产能如何提前分配</strong>。时段与截单的一般机制见 <a href=\"../gift-payment-scheduled/scheduled-delivery-date-window\">预约送达日期、时段与截单</a>，申报侧的时间要求见 <a href=\"gift-customs-recipient-declare\">礼品跨境清关的收件人申报</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>节日履约的第一个建模对象是<strong>日历本身</strong>。这看起来是查表，实际上有两类节日必须分开处理：<strong>固定日期节日</strong>（公历 12 月 25 日）与<strong>浮动节日</strong>（复活节、感恩节、农历新年、排灯节）。前者可以直接写成日期，后者必须由规则算出，且规则要能表达&quot;某月的第几个星期几&quot;这类结构。iCalendar 规范的重复规则正是为这种表达设计的：<code>recur = recur-rule-part *( &quot;;&quot; recur-rule-part )</code>，其中 <code>FREQ</code> 必须出现且只能是第一个规则部分，<code>UNTIL</code> 与 <code>COUNT</code> 二者不得同时出现，<code>enddate = date / date-time</code>，<code>freq</code> 取值包括 <code>DAILY / WEEKLY / MONTHLY / YEARLY</code>，配合 <code>BYDAY</code>、<code>BYMONTHDAY</code>、<code>BYMONTH</code>、<code>BYSETPOS</code> 等部分表达&quot;十一月第四个星期四&quot;这类规则（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545.html\">RFC 5545 §3.3.10</a>）。用这个模型表达节日，比手工维护一张节日表更可维护——尤其是当业务扩展到新的国家时。</p>\n<p>第二个概念是<strong>节日会产生双重的产能冲击</strong>：需求端在同一周集中爆发，供给端同时收缩（承运商假日减班、仓库员工排班下降、海关清关停摆）。因此节日履约不是&quot;提前备货&quot;这一个动作，而是<strong>需求侧的可预约性收缩</strong>与<strong>供给侧的资源预留</strong>同时进行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[节日日历配置&lt;br/&gt;固定 + 浮动规则] --&gt; B[计算每个节日的日期]&#10;  B --&gt; C[反推各环节截单时间]&#10;  C --&gt; D[仓库拣货截单]&#10;  C --&gt; E[干线发车截单]&#10;  C --&gt; F[清关申报截单]&#10;  C --&gt; G[末端投递截单]&#10;  D --&gt; H[生成可预约性日历&lt;br/&gt;封锁不可达日期]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[前端只展示可履约日期]&#10;  I --&gt; J[履约排产按峰值预留产能]&#10;  J --&gt; K[节日当天投递]\">graph TD\n  A[节日日历配置&lt;br/&gt;固定 + 浮动规则] --&gt; B[计算每个节日的日期]\n  B --&gt; C[反推各环节截单时间]\n  C --&gt; D[仓库拣货截单]\n  C --&gt; E[干线发车截单]\n  C --&gt; F[清关申报截单]\n  C --&gt; G[末端投递截单]\n  D --&gt; H[生成可预约性日历&lt;br/&gt;封锁不可达日期]\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[前端只展示可履约日期]\n  I --&gt; J[履约排产按峰值预留产能]\n  J --&gt; K[节日当天投递]</pre><h2 id=\"节日日历建模\">节日日历建模</h2><h3 id=\"固定与浮动-一张表还是两套机制\">固定与浮动：一张表还是两套机制</h3><p>把节日写死成日期表在第一个&quot;农历新年&quot;上就会失效——农历新年在公历上的日期每年移动，通常会落在 1 月下旬到 2 月中旬之间。更糟的是<strong>区域性差异</strong>：同一节日在不同国家的休假安排、承运商停运窗口各不相同。因此日历的最小正确模型是三层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;calendar_version&quot;: &quot;2026.4&quot;,&#10;  &quot;effective_from&quot;: &quot;2026-01-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;holidays&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;holiday_code&quot;: &quot;CHRISTMAS&quot;,&#10;      &quot;recurrence&quot;: &quot;FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=12;BYMONTHDAY=25&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: { &quot;markets&quot;: [&quot;US&quot;, &quot;GB&quot;, &quot;DE&quot;, &quot;FR&quot;, &quot;AU&quot;] },&#10;      &quot;demand_peak&quot;: { &quot;start_offset_days&quot;: -21, &quot;end_offset_days&quot;: -2 },&#10;      &quot;capacity&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;warehouse_pick_cutoff_offset_days&quot;: -3,&#10;        &quot;carrier_dispatch_cutoff_offset_days&quot;: -2,&#10;        &quot;customs_needs_clearance_by_days&quot;: -5&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;holiday_code&quot;: &quot;THANKSGIVING_US&quot;,&#10;      &quot;recurrence&quot;: &quot;FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=11;BYDAY=4TH&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: { &quot;markets&quot;: [&quot;US&quot;] },&#10;      &quot;demand_peak&quot;: { &quot;start_offset_days&quot;: -14, &quot;end_offset_days&quot;: 1 }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;holiday_code&quot;: &quot;LUNAR_NEW_YEAR&quot;,&#10;      &quot;recurrence&quot;: &quot;EXTERNAL:CALENDAR_TABLE:CN_LUNAR&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: { &quot;markets&quot;: [&quot;CN&quot;, &quot;SG&quot;, &quot;MY&quot;, &quot;VN&quot;, &quot;KR&quot;] },&#10;      &quot;demand_peak&quot;: { &quot;start_offset_days&quot;: -28, &quot;end_offset_days&quot;: -1 }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"calendar_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"holidays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"holiday_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CHRISTMAS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"recurrence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=12;BYMONTHDAY=25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"markets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"demand_peak\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"start_offset_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-21</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"end_offset_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"capacity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"warehouse_pick_cutoff_offset_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"carrier_dispatch_cutoff_offset_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"customs_needs_clearance_by_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"holiday_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"THANKSGIVING_US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"recurrence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=11;BYDAY=4TH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"markets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"demand_peak\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"start_offset_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"end_offset_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"holiday_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LUNAR_NEW_YEAR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"recurrence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EXTERNAL:CALENDAR_TABLE:CN_LUNAR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"markets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SG\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"demand_peak\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"start_offset_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"end_offset_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意第三项：农历新年的规则<strong>不能</strong>用 RFC 5545 的 <code>BYMONTH/BYDAY</code> 表达（它是阴阳历，没有简单的公历递归规则），因此模型必须支持 <code>EXTERNAL:</code> 这类外挂日历源，由一份逐年维护的农历表提供日期。这个设计选择的好处是把&quot;能规则化的&quot;与&quot;必须查表的&quot;分开——前者的复用性高，后者的维护成本被隔离在一个明确的边界内。</p>\n<h3 id=\"峰值窗口不是节日当天\">峰值窗口不是节日当天</h3><p>上例中 <code>demand_peak.start_offset_days</code> 是一个负数偏移，表示<strong>需求峰值在节日之前</strong>。这个建模很重要：跨境电商的节日履约压力 90% 落在节日前的两到三周，节日当天反而是低谷。工程上如果按&quot;节日当天&quot;来预留产能，会完全错配。</p>\n<p>峰值窗口的长度因节日而异，且与<strong>文化上的送礼准备期</strong>相关：圣诞节的准备期长（美国的购物季从感恩节后开始），情人节的准备期短而陡。这个差异直接影响仓库的波峰设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"截单时间随节日偏移\">截单时间随节日偏移</h2><h3 id=\"从节日日期反推四道截单\">从节日日期反推四道截单</h3><p>每道截单都从目标到达日往回推，取所有约束中最紧的那个。节日会增加两类额外偏移：<strong>承运商停运</strong>（节日当天与前后不取件）与<strong>清关停摆</strong>（海关假日不上班，申报必须在最后一个工作日前完成）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def holiday_cutoff(target_date, market, holiday):&#10;    offsets = []&#10;    offsets.append(target_date - timedelta(days=holiday.capacity.carrier_dispatch_cutoff_offset_days))&#10;    offsets.append(target_date - timedelta(days=holiday.capacity.warehouse_pick_cutoff_offset_days))&#10;    if market.requires_customs:&#10;        # 清关必须在前一个工作日完成，而非简单的自然日偏移&#10;        clear_by = prev_business_day(&#10;            target_date - timedelta(days=holiday.capacity.customs_needs_clearance_by_days),&#10;            market.holiday_calendar)&#10;        offsets.append(clear_by - market.customs_lead_time_days)&#10;    if market in holiday.affected_markets and holiday.demand_peak.active(target_date):&#10;        offsets.append(target_date - timedelta(days=market.peak_buffer_days))&#10;    return min(offsets)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> holiday_cutoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target_date, market, holiday):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    offsets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    offsets.append(target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">holiday.capacity.carrier_dispatch_cutoff_offset_days))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    offsets.append(target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">holiday.capacity.warehouse_pick_cutoff_offset_days))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market.requires_customs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 清关必须在前一个工作日完成，而非简单的自然日偏移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        clear_by </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev_business_day(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">holiday.capacity.customs_needs_clearance_by_days),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            market.holiday_calendar)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        offsets.append(clear_by </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market.customs_lead_time_days)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> holiday.affected_markets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> holiday.demand_peak.active(target_date):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        offsets.append(target_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">market.peak_buffer_days))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(offsets)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>prev_business_day</code> 这一步是容易被漏掉的细节：节假日期间&quot;提前 5 天&quot;与&quot;提前 5 个自然日&quot;差别巨大，因为其中可能夹着一个长周末。所有涉及工作日概念的偏移都必须走工作日历函数，而不是自然日减法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"截单时间的对外表达\">截单时间的对外表达</h3><p>截单时间对用户展示时要转成<strong>用户本地时区</strong>并给出明确语义。这里有一个实际的沟通问题：促销页面上的&quot;保证节前送达&quot;必须绑定一个具体的时间点，而这个时间点应该按<strong>目的国</strong>而非付款人所在地计算——礼物最终要按时到达的是收件人所在的国家。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表述</th>\n<th>是否可用</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;保证节前送达&quot; 无日期</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无法举证，客服争议无依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;12 月 21 日 23:59 前下单&quot; 无时区</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>跨时区用户理解偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;12 月 21 日 23:59（收件人当地时间）前下单&quot;</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>语义完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;预计节前送达&quot;</td>\n<td>是（期望类）</td>\n<td>需与承诺类在数据上分离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这与 <a href=\"../gift-payment-scheduled/scheduled-delivery-date-window\">预约送达</a> 中&quot;承诺与期望必须分离&quot;的原则是同一条，节日场景只是把它的商业后果放大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"峰值产能的预留与降级\">峰值产能的预留与降级</h2><h3 id=\"需求侧的收缩先于供给侧的扩张\">需求侧的收缩先于供给侧的扩张</h3><p>节日履约的第一手段不是&quot;加班&quot;，而是<strong>收缩可预约性</strong>。具体做法是：把不可达的日期从可预约日历中移除，而不是接受预约后再改约。理由在前文已述——越晚决策，可选时段越少、补偿越高。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE peak_capacity_reservation (&#10;  reservation_id  BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  holiday_code    VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  market          CHAR(2)     NOT NULL,&#10;  facility_code   VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  resource_type   VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,  -- PICK | PACK | LINEHAUL | LASTMILE&#10;  window_start    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  window_end      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  reserved_units  INT         NOT NULL,  -- 例如可用工时或车辆位&#10;  committed_units INT         NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  release_policy  VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,  -- HARD_BLOCK | OVERBOOK_CONTROLLED&#10;  CONSTRAINT ck_window CHECK (window_end &gt; window_start),&#10;  CONSTRAINT ck_release CHECK (release_policy IN (&#39;HARD_BLOCK&#39;,&#39;OVERBOOK_CONTROLLED&#39;))&#10;);&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_peak_resource ON peak_capacity_reservation&#10;  (holiday_code, market, facility_code, resource_type, window_start);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> peak_capacity_reservation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reservation_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  holiday_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  facility_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resource_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PICK | PACK | LINEHAUL | LASTMILE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_start    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_end      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reserved_units  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 例如可用工时或车辆位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  committed_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  release_policy  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- HARD_BLOCK | OVERBOOK_CONTROLLED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ck_window </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (window_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window_start),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ck_release </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (release_policy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HARD_BLOCK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OVERBOOK_CONTROLLED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_peak_resource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak_capacity_reservation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (holiday_code, market, facility_code, resource_type, window_start);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>release_policy</code> 是这张表最有价值的一列。<code>HARD_BLOCK</code> 表示该资源在窗口内不对外售卖（用于运力硬约束，如干线车辆数）；<code>OVERBOOK_CONTROLLED</code> 表示可以有控制地超售（用于拣货工时这类弹性资源，因为临时工可以补）。把两类资源用同一个字段区分，避免了&quot;要么全锁死、要么全超售&quot;的两种极端。</p>\n<h3 id=\"降级路径必须提前设计\">降级路径必须提前设计</h3><p>峰值期的降级不是失败，而是<strong>预案</strong>。四类降级按代价从低到高排列：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>降准时精度</strong>：从&quot;两小时窗口&quot;降为&quot;半天&quot;，保留到达日。</li>\n<li><strong>降预约性</strong>：封锁部分日期的预约，只保留日期不保留时段。</li>\n<li><strong>切换承运商</strong>：从高价高保真的服务切到较慢但产能更足的网络（这会降低末端体验）。</li>\n<li><strong>主动改约</strong>：联系付款人改到节后，并给出补偿。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>前两类应在系统里自动化，后两类需要人工介入但必须有明确的触发阈值。这里最容易犯的错误是<strong>等到达峰值当天才发现产能不足</strong>——此时第 4 类降级的成本已经远高于第 1 类。因此产能监控要在峰值窗口开始前就进入预警状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与末端网络的交接\">与末端网络的交接</h3><p>峰值期的末端投递是另一个瓶颈，尤其是当礼物需要&quot;送到人手上&quot;而非塞进快递柜时。这部分与相邻的末端网络主题相邻（本目录下的全球末端配送网络 hub 有更完整的处理），本 hub 只负责把预约信息与截单结果准确传递过去。接口的关键是<strong>传递约束而不是传递计划</strong>：末端系统应该收到&quot;这批货必须在 12 月 24 日投递、时间窗为上午、必须交接给人&quot;这样的约束集合，而不是一条被上游算好的路线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>节日日历必须同时支持<strong>固定日期</strong>与<strong>浮动规则</strong>；后者用 iCalendar 的重复规则表达（<code>FREQ</code> 必须存在且居首，<code>UNTIL</code> 与 <code>COUNT</code> 互斥，见 <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545.html\">RFC 5545 §3.3.10</a>），而农历这类无法规则化的节日需要外挂日历源。</li>\n<li><strong>峰值窗口在节日之前</strong>，通常前置两到三周；按节日当天预留产能会完全错配。</li>\n<li>每道截单从到达日反推并取最紧者；涉及&quot;工作日&quot;的偏移必须走工作日历函数，不能做自然日减法。</li>\n<li>截单对外表述必须带<strong>收件人当地时区</strong>与具体时刻；&quot;保证节前送达&quot;这类无日期的承诺不可举证，应与&quot;期望类&quot;在数据上分离。</li>\n<li>节日履约的第一手段是<strong>收缩可预约性</strong>（从可预约日历移除不可达日期），而不是接受预约后改约。</li>\n<li>产能预留要区分 <code>HARD_BLOCK</code>（运力硬约束）与 <code>OVERBOOK_CONTROLLED</code>（弹性资源可控制超售）。</li>\n<li>降级路径必须按代价排序并预设触发阈值，核心目标是<strong>在峰值窗口开始前进入预警</strong>，而非等到当天。</li>\n<li>与末端网络的接口应传递<strong>约束集合</strong>（到达日、时间窗、交接要求）而非上游算好的路线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨境节日日历与履约截单","id":"跨境节日日历与履约截单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"节日日历建模","id":"节日日历建模"},{"level":3,"text":"固定与浮动：一张表还是两套机制","id":"固定与浮动-一张表还是两套机制"},{"level":3,"text":"峰值窗口不是节日当天","id":"峰值窗口不是节日当天"},{"level":2,"text":"截单时间随节日偏移","id":"截单时间随节日偏移"},{"level":3,"text":"从节日日期反推四道截单","id":"从节日日期反推四道截单"},{"level":3,"text":"截单时间的对外表达","id":"截单时间的对外表达"},{"level":2,"text":"峰值产能的预留与降级","id":"峰值产能的预留与降级"},{"level":3,"text":"需求侧的收缩先于供给侧的扩张","id":"需求侧的收缩先于供给侧的扩张"},{"level":3,"text":"降级路径必须提前设计","id":"降级路径必须提前设计"},{"level":3,"text":"与末端网络的交接","id":"与末端网络的交接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"礼品跨境清关的收件人申报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-order-payforward-delivery/gift-fulfillment-customs/gift-customs-recipient-declare"},"next":{"title":"礼品包装与尾程交接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gift-order-payforward-delivery/gift-fulfillment-customs/gift-packaging-lastmile-handling"}}